"""tuinotepad - a persistent, tabbed notepad for the terminal.

Modeled on DankMaterialShell's notepad (Meta+Shift+N): every tab is a note
that saves itself, tabs survive restarts, and real files can be opened in
tabs next to the notes. Single file, Python 3.8+ standard library only.

Storage uses the same layout as DMS (notepad-session.json + notepad-files/),
so `--dms` can share notes with a running DankMaterialShell.
"""

